<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Resin Casting on eQualle Blog</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/tags/resin-casting/</link><description>Recent posts on eQualle Blog</description><generator>Hugo 0.150.1</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:02:54 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.equalle.com/tags/resin-casting/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Finishing At 3000 Grit To Speed Polish</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:02:51 +0000</pubDate><category>Grit Range &amp; Classification</category><category>grit-800</category><category>grit-2000</category><category>grit-2400</category><category>grit-3000</category><category>clear coat</category><category>resin casting</category><category>wet sanding</category><category>mirror finish</category><category>polishing pads</category><description>Learn how finishing at 3000-grit speeds polishing with clear steps, tool setup, and pro tips for metal, resin, and paint to reach gloss fast.</description><summary>&lt;h2 id="sandpaper-grit-3000-for-faster-polishing"&gt;Sandpaper grit 3000 for faster polishing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Saturday afternoon light angles across your workbench. There’s a piece you’ve been living with for weeks now—a motorcycle cover, a resin casting, maybe a metal panel from a restoration project—almost finished, not quite gleaming. You’ve already invested hours stepping through the paper stack, rinsing, wiping, inspecting. Still, the last 10% of the job feels like the last 90% of the effort. That’s where smart use of sandpaper grit, especially finishing at 3000, starts to feel less like a detail and more like a turning point. The moment a faint reflection becomes clear, the surface stops fighting you and starts cooperating.&lt;/p&gt;</summary><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/images/brand/01.webp" medium="image"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/instagram/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/pinterest/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/07/20/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit/cards/facebook/finishing-at-3000-grit-to-speed-polish-sandpaper-grit.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><readingTime>12</readingTime></item><item><title>Waterproof Binders For Wet Sanding</title><link>https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 14:17:23 +0000</pubDate><category>Abrasive Materials &amp; Compounds</category><category>grit-150</category><category>grit-1000</category><category>grit-2000</category><category>wet sanding</category><category>dry sanding</category><category>clear coat</category><category>resin casting</category><category>grit progression</category><description>Learn how waterproof binders and silicon carbide sandpaper work together for flawless wet sanding, from materials to technique, tips, and troubleshooting.</description><summary>&lt;h2 id="silicon-carbide-sandpaper-and-waterproof-binders"&gt;Silicon carbide sandpaper and waterproof binders&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s a moment in every finishing project when you catch the light just right and see everything: the soft glow of a guitar body after hours of smoothing, the mirror sheen on a freshly clear-coated fender, or the glassy countertop you’ve sanded patiently between pours. Wet sanding is often the bridge to that moment—quiet, controlled, and surprisingly meditative. But if you’ve ever had a sheet turn mushy halfway through, watched abrasive grains shed from the backing, or dealt with that relentless gummy slurry, you’ve met the hidden variable many overlook: the waterproof binder.&lt;/p&gt;</summary><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/images/brand/26.webp" medium="image"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/instagram/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/instagram/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/instagram/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/pinterest/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/pinterest/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/pinterest/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.equalle.com/posts/2026/01/07/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper/cards/facebook/waterproof-binders-for-wet-sanding-silicon-carbide-sandpaper.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><readingTime>12</readingTime></item></channel></rss>